       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Esmé Cowles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Tomcat (as of 8.0.34, 8.5.1) does not set the Content-Length header when responding to GET requests.  See <a href=\"https://bz.apache.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=59310#c8\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://bz.apache.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=59310#c8</a></p>",
     "created": "15/Sep/17 11:07 AM",
     "id": "19342",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12546/comment/19342",
     "updateAuthor": {
